els feels like a  very 20 20 thing this is very now thing  maybe that's because the short attention  span of the internet but  this is of this is an ongoing thing this  has been a thing  and this will continue to be a thing  we have to spread the message we have to  be responsible and use our voices  and we have to move the needle thanks  for listening  and i'll catch you guys in the next tech  video  peace

